      <description><![CDATA[<b>AI and the Budget Filmmaker</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Wed 3rd Jun<br>The Hub at Lower Sydney Town Hall, Sydney<br>Check site<br><br>What does AI offer filmmakers working with limited resources whilst honouring the work of artists? This forward-looking discussion considers how emerging technologies are reshaping creative workflows, opening new possibilities for storytelling at the lowest budget levels.<br><br><a href="https://www.sff.org.au/info/festival-hub">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
