      <description><![CDATA[<b>Local Talent, Global Storytelling</b><br><i>Arts &amp; Culture</i><br>Wed 3rd Jun<br>The Hub at Lower Sydney Town Hall, Sydney<br>Check site<br><br>Presented by Screen Australia this session explores global storytelling through a uniquely Australian lens, and why international perspective is increasingly vital to the industry. Join Selina Miles (Silenced), Camilla Mazzaferro (Whistle) and Andy Huang (Replica) moderated by Screen Australia’s Richard Huddleston.<br><br><a href="https://www.sff.org.au/info/festival-hub">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
